{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancible Online </strong>plunges you into a thrilling 2D online world where action and adventure never cease! Grab your gear, choose your class, and prepare for endless quests across a sprawling, diverse map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442160/extras/de9b1235329ac457f6492809a332b6ae.avif?t=1761333888\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the world of <strong>Veridia</strong>\u00a0traversing dangerous terrain and mysterious dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442160/extras/9ba93886d2e8d03e8bf43ee98872705c.avif?t=1761333888\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customize</strong> your character through items, cosmetics, and talents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442160/extras/37adf70ce097680870c1b538561c8235.avif?t=1761333888\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gather</strong> materials and <strong>craft</strong> items to help you on your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442160/extras/90b9096dbd7097780911d93db70d44c8.avif?t=1761333888\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Party</strong> with your friends,<strong> create guilds</strong>, and<strong> trade</strong>\u00a0with others!</p><